'''Early Axes''' are the first dual wielded [[Axes|axe]].

* Its primary attack is a 4-step combo: two single hits, one with each axe, followed by two double hits using both axes simultaneously, resulting in a total of 6 hits. The final double hit deals 2x damage with each individual hit.
* The secondary attack costs 12 stamina and is a leap forward, followed by a slash with both axes for a single hit, dealing 1.5x damage.

The Early Axes deal [[Chop]] damage and can cut down the same trees as the [[Bronze Axe]], such as [[Birch]]es, [[Oak]]s and [[Ancient Tree]]s.

== Crafting ==
Early Axes can be crafted at a [[Workbench]] with [[Wood]], [[Leather Scraps]] and two rare components:
* '''{{Item link|Curious Axe Head|nolink=1}}''' can be found inside a chest in variant 6 of the [[Abandoned House]].
* '''{{Item link|Mysterious Axe Head|nolink=1}}''' can be found inside a chest in variant 2 of the Abandoned House.

